{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15114510","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15114510","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1511451001:1":{"text":"두툰, 일어나.","source_cn":"顿，醒醒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C5A79FBE8AD9C7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1511451002:0":{"text":"음... 나페이? 내가 왜 여기에...","source_cn":"唔……那非？我怎么在这……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD936C5FC08CA1080","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511451003:0":{"text":"쓰읍...! 아... 머리야...","source_cn":"嘶……！我的头好疼……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39C1512120D4E8AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511451004:1":{"text":"내가 때렸어. 제압하려면 어쩔 수 없었거든.","source_cn":"是我打的。为了制服你，我只能这样做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BAB7F441D355445","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511451005:0":{"text":"뭐? 갑자기 왜?!","source_cn":"你！你没事干嘛打我？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B20CE933E5FA2B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511451006:0":{"text":"...전혀 기억하지 못하는 거야?","source_cn":"……你不记得刚才发生的事了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDD9BF709E91D924","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511451007:0":{"text":"뭐를? 혹시 나 많이 때렸어?","source_cn":"我该记得什么？你给了我几拳吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD222D935C48A95D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1511451008:0":{"text":"맞아서 기억이 날아간 건가? 어휴, 아파 죽겠네...","source_cn":"噢，这么说来，我就是被你给打失忆了吧！嘶，真疼啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9D33C76348F49E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1511451009:0":{"text":"아메스는? 나랑 같이 있었는데. ","source_cn":"对了，阿米呢？我原本应该和她在一起的啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E2D877E03FA4ED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511451010:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:12:1511451011:1":{"text":"나페이는 방금 일어난 일을 두툰에게 설명했다","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63ACC4F3B42E80A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1511451012:1":{"text":"메히라의 위장과... 아메스의 죽음까지 전부 다...","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54486652CFCFD0EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1511451013:0":{"text":"<sad>아메스... 왜... 대체 왜?!</sad>","source_cn":"<sad>阿米……为什么……为什么会这样？</sad>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D860CAC07E217BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1511451014:0":{"text":"난... 악마가 위장한 것도 모르고 속아 넘어갔어...","source_cn":"我……我非但没看破那个恶魔的伪装，还上了她的当……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CCBBBF3B96070F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1511451015:0":{"text":"아메스를 죽인 악마... 복수하겠어!","source_cn":"我应该替阿米报仇的！是那个恶魔杀了她——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6864E3AF671629F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1511451016:0":{"text":"<shk>전부... 전부 내 잘못이야! 내가 너무 쓸모없었어...!</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>都是……都是我的错！是我太没用了……！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48907F0F01A4D596","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1511451017:0":{"text":"...네 탓 아니야, 두툰.","source_cn":"……别伤心了，顿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75655DE3E715D137","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1511451018:0":{"text":"그리고 아메스와 현혹된 전사들의 복수는 내가 마쳤어.","source_cn":"我已经替阿米，还有那些受到蛊惑的战士报仇了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC5DFE1BFF8DD143","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1511451019:0":{"text":"난... 내 자신을 용서할 수 없어...","source_cn":"我……我还是不能原谅自己……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x217312A6AD6173D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1511451020:0":{"text":"...정말 아메스를 위해 무언가 하고 싶다면 지금까지 잡은 사냥감으로 붉은 사냥제에서 우승하자.","source_cn":"……如果你真想为阿米做点什么，就带着我们一起打到的猎物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FC6C52D22973575","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1511451021:0":{"text":"세어보니 우리 둘을 제외한 나머지 전사들은 짐승의 발톱에 목숨을 잃었거나 악마의 꾐에 넘어가 서로를 무참히 죽였어.","source_cn":"我算过人数。除了你我，其他战士要么死在了野兽爪下，要么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE00B9BF2F55A6EA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1511451022:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">생존자는 우리 둘뿐이야</style>. 사냥감을 가지고 분노의 골짜기로 돌아가면 아메스와 타이젠 역시 우리와 함께 용사가 되어, 두 사람의 영혼이 영원히 아쿠보르의 달 곁에 머물 수 있을 거야.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>你我是唯一的幸存者<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DAD7253E2711A41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1511451023:0":{"text":"...그래. 그 둘을 위해서라도 힘을 내야지...","source_cn":"……对，你说的对。为了阿米和泰泽，我得振作起来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDC381683BE88401","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1511451024:0":{"text":"하지만 짐승의 군주님은... 악마가 붉은 사냥제를 망치는 걸 보고도 왜 막지 않으신 거지?","source_cn":"可是兽群之主……她为什么坐视恶魔破坏猎血节，却不加以制止？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD927567A81D0FC81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1511451025:1":{"text":"...잘 모르겠어...","source_cn":"……我不知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x308312031E0B19C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1511451026:0":{"text":"어쩌면 신께서는 우리를 보시지 않고 결과만을 기다리고 계셨을지도...","source_cn":"或许，神并没有真正将目光投来，她只是在等待结果……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51D740B6786D1331","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:28:1511451026":{"tex